<title>UK: UK budget does to little to curb spending - Ashdown.</title>
<headline>UK budget does to little to curb spending - Ashdown.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liberal Democrat leader Paddy Ashdown said Wednesday's budget had not done enough to rein back British consumer spending.</p>
<p>&quot;Instead of shackling businesses he should have restrained the consumer in order to prevent the higher interest rate, higher inflation...that in our view will now surely follow,&quot; Ashdown said in a speech to parliament. -- London Newsroom +44 171 5427767</p>
</text>
